{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05425","headline":"奉和圣制送张说巡边 · 韩休","name":"奉和圣制送张说巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一德光台象，三军掌夏卿。\n来威申庙略，出总叶师贞。\n受钺辞金殿，凭轩去鼎城。\n曙光摇组甲，疎吹绕云旌。\n左律方先凯，中鼙即训兵。\n定功彰武事，陈颂纪天声。\n祖宴初留赏，宸章更宠行。\n车徒零雨送，林野夕阴生。\n路极河流远，川长朔气平。\n南辕迟返斾，归奏谒承明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}